    {
      "id": "Asum",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240.0,
      "y": 590.0,
      "width": 694.0,
      "height": 160.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2295,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2302,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE touches: Location Service -> geo index (latest only) + Kafka\n-> trip tracker -> push to the rider (live location, only on a ride).\nRequest: Ride Service -> Rides (SQL) + outbox -> Kafka -> matching\nworker -> driver lock (NX) -> offer. Accept: ONE conditional UPDATE\ndecides the winner. End -> ride-ended -> Payment Service charges once.\n\nREAD touches: Pricing (Maps API), Ride Service (SQL replica).\nThe driver's position reaches the rider by PUSH, not polling.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRITE touches: Location Service -> geo index (latest only) + Kafka\n-> trip tracker -> push to the rider (live location, only on a ride).\nRequest: Ride Service -> Rides (SQL) + outbox -> Kafka -> matching\nworker -> driver lock (NX) -> offer. Accept: ONE conditional UPDATE\ndecides the winner. End -> ride-ended -> Payment Service charges once.\n\nREAD touches: Pricing (Maps API), Ride Service (SQL replica).\nThe driver's position reaches the rider by PUSH, not polling.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
